===Alternative forms===
* [[twelfe]] (obsolete, but the corresponding pronunciation {{IPAchar|/twɛlf/}} is still widespread today)
* [[twelveth]] (archaic)

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|twelfthe}}, {{m|enm|twelfte}}, from {{inh|en|ang|twelfta|t=twelfth}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*twaliftô|t=twelfth}}, equivalent to {{af|en|twelve|-th}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|twalt|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|stq|tweelfte|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|fy|tolfde|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|nl|twaalfde|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|nds-de|twalfde}}, {{m|nds-de|twalvde|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|de|zwölfte|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|da|tolvte|t=twelfth}},
{{cog|sv|tolfte|t=twelfth}}, {{cog|is|tólfta|t=twelfth}}.

