===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{cln|en|ordinal numbers}} The [[ordinal]] form of the [[number]] [[twelve]], describing a person or thing in position number [[12]] of a sequence.
#: ''The answer appears on the '''twelfth''' page of the book.''
#: ''She finished '''twelfth''' in the race.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|ordinal form of twelve}} {{l|en|12th}}, 12<sup>th</sup>, {{l|en|XIIth}}; [[XII]] {{qualifier|in names of monarchs and popes}}; [[dozenth]]

